      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "622. 利用函数 $y=2^x$ 的图象找出下列各式的值所处的界限：",
        "а) $2^{\\sqrt{2}}$，已知 $1.4<\\sqrt{2}<1.5$，",
        "б) $2^{\\sqrt[3]{5}}$，已知 $1.7<\\sqrt[3]{5}<1.8$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "623",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "623. 指出变量 $x$ 的几个值，使得式 $2^x$ 的值：",
        "а) 分别大于0，1，32，100，1000；",
        "б) 分别小于1，$\\frac{1}{64}$，$0.002$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "624",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "624. 证明：",
        "а) $(x>7)\\Rightarrow(2^x>100)$； б) $(x<-3)\\Rightarrow(2^x<0.2)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "625",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "625. а) 由不等式 $x\\geqslant5$ 能得出下列不等式吗？",
        "$2^x>50$； $2^x>30$.",
        "б) 由不等式 $x<-3$ 能得出下列不等式吗？",
        "$2^x<10$； $2^x<0.1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "626",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "626. 解下列方程和不等式：",
        "а) $2^x=4$， $2^x>4$， $2^x<4$；",
        "б) $2^x=\\frac{1}{2}$， $2^x>\\frac{1}{2}$， $2^x<\\frac{1}{2}$；",
        "в) $2^x=-5$， $2^x>-5$， $2^x<-5$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "复习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "627",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "627. 化简：",
        "а) $(2x^{0.75}+3x^{0.25})^2-4x^{0.5}(x+2.25)$；",
        "б) $\\frac{a^{1.5}-b^{1.5}}{a^{0.5}}\\div\\left(\\frac{a^{0.5}+b^{0.5}}{a^{0.5}}-\\frac{b^{0.5}}{a^{0.5}+b^{0.5}}\\right)$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
